=== meta ===
rule: TEST_DISABLED
title: `TestTotal = None` after a test class takes all its tests out of the run
origin: #424 R5, ruling 424 Q1 (b) - a rebound test class takes its units with it; v0.8.0 reported nothing
=== before: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app.billing import total


class TestTotal:
    def test_total(self):
        assert total([50.0, 28.75]) == 78.75
=== after: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app.billing import total


class TestTotal:
    def test_total(self):
        assert total([50.0, 28.75]) == 78.75


TestTotal = None
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "TEST_DISABLED", "severity": "high", "unit": "TestTotal.test_total"}]
